      "content": "it's not really chest pressure, just more like I'm a bit winded when I walk across the room. the leg pain is mostly just a sharp ache. do u think i could just take some ibuprofen and drink a bunch of water and sleep it off? i'm so tired i don't really want to sit in an ER waiting room if it's just being dehydrated from the flight.",
